( 01 / Python fundamentals and configuration) Tj T*
( What, why and how) Tj T*
( The file is a CLI learning reference. Imports load libraries; functions define reusable behavior;) Tj T*
( dataclasses group settings; type hints describe expected types. Config is frozen and reads) Tj T*
( environment variables. C is the shared configuration instance. Defaults include 384 vector) Tj T*
( dimensions, 1100 characters per chunk, 180 overlap, 30-second HTTP timeout and three attempts.) Tj T*
( In .NET think of appsettings, records, using statements and methods. Environment variables allow) Tj T*
( changes without editing source. Never use demo credentials in production.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
