(    18 |) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    19 | """AriNova A-to-Z AI Architecture Lab -- SINGLE FILE, real PostgreSQL hybrid RAG.) Tj T*
(    20 |) Tj T*
(    21 | INSTALL \(Python 3.11+\):) Tj T*
(    22 |   pip install 'psycopg[binary]' pgvector sentence-transformers pypdf langgraph) Tj T*
(    23 |   # optional: pip install opentelemetry-api opentelemetry-sdk) Tj T*
(    24 | INFRA:) Tj T*
(    25 |   docker run --name arinova-pg -e POSTGRES_PASSWORD=postgres -e POSTGRES_DB=arinova -p 5432:5432 -d) Tj T*
(       | pgvector/pgvector:pg17) Tj T*
(    26 |   ollama pull llama3.2 && ollama serve # if not already running) Tj T*
(    27 | RUN:) Tj T*
(    28 |   python arinova_architect_a_to_z.py --init) Tj T*
(    29 |   python arinova_architect_a_to_z.py --ingest policy.pdf --tenant acme --actor admin) Tj T*
(    30 |   python arinova_architect_a_to_z.py --ask 'How many leaves?' --tenant acme --actor reader) Tj T*
(    31 |   python arinova_architect_a_to_z.py --eval --tenant acme --actor reader) Tj T*
(    32 |   python arinova_architect_a_to_z.py --tests # no infrastructure needed) Tj T*
(    33 | ENV:) Tj T*
(    34 |   ARINOVA_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/arinova) Tj T*
(    35 |   ARINOVA_OLLAMA_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434/api/generate) Tj T*
(    36 |   ARINOVA_MODEL=llama3.2) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    37 |) Tj T*
(    38 | READ THIS FIRST: educational *connected* reference, not a production deployment.) Tj T*
(    39 | It genuinely uses pgvector, PostgreSQL full-text search, RRF hybrid ranking,) Tj T*
(    40 | local sentence-transformer embeddings, a cross-encoder reranker, Ollama inference,) Tj T*
(    41 | LangGraph orchestration, SQL checkpoints, audit and DLQ. No fake vector search.) Tj T*
(    42 | Auth defaults to a trusted-actor CLI demo; optional verified OIDC JWT is provided; production must verify) Tj T*
(       | tokens at) Tj T*
(    43 | an API gateway and derive tenant from authenticated identity, not user input.) Tj T*
(    44 | Prompt injection filters are defense-in-depth heuristics, NOT a security boundary.) Tj T*
(    45 | No guarantee of atomicity across external LLM calls. Human approvals are) Tj T*
(    46 | represented as a persisted pending status, NOT an interactive approval service.) Tj T*
