( 04 / Authorization and input guardrails) Tj T*
( What, why and how) Tj T*
( authorize checks role permissions. Authentication means who you are; authorization means what) Tj T*
( you can do; tenant isolation means whose data you can access. validate_question checks length) Tj T*
( and validity; suspicious detects selected injection patterns; redact masks selected sensitive) Tj T*
( patterns. Pattern matching is not a complete security boundary. Treat retrieved content as) Tj T*
( untrusted data.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
( Practical learning) Tj T*
( Try an invalid question and a synthetic injection phrase. CLI roles are educational, not verified user) Tj T*
( identities.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
