( 08 / Ollama, prompts and grounded) Tj T*
( answers) Tj T*
( What, why and how) Tj T*
( ollama sends an HTTP generation request to the configured local model endpoint. make_prompt) Tj T*
( combines instructions, question and bounded evidence. grounded_answer generates text and) Tj T*
( builds citation metadata. Lower temperature reduces randomness but cannot guarantee) Tj T*
( correctness. A citation identifies a source; it does not prove that every claim is supported.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
( Practical learning) Tj T*
( Evidence: employees receive 12 casual leaves annually. Ask how many leaves are allowed.) Tj T*
( Compare the answer and cited page against the original PDF.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
