( 11 / Unified LangGraph workflow) Tj T*
( What, why and how) Tj T*
( LangGraph represents operations as nodes, transitions as edges and shared data as state.) Tj T*
( run_unified_graph coordinates retrieval, validation, generation and quality evaluation. The) Tj T*
( workflow is controlled rather than a fully autonomous agent. Use deterministic routing where) Tj T*
( possible.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
( Practical learning) Tj T*
( Follow the state in a debugger: question, tenant, documents, result and quality. Inspect failure) Tj T*
( paths. Durable graph resumption requires additional integration validation.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
