( 12 / Central AI execution pipeline) Tj T*
( What, why and how) Tj T*
( execute_ai_pipeline establishes identity and delegates to _execute_verified_pipeline. The core) Tj T*
( checks authorization and input, derives workflow ID, checks completed results, records state,) Tj T*
( executes the graph, checks cancellation and persists result and audit. Exceptions distinguish) Tj T*
( cancellation from failure and determine DLQ eligibility. ask is the public wrapper.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
( Practical learning) Tj T*
( Follow main -> ask -> execute_ai_pipeline -> _execute_verified_pipeline -> run_unified_graph.) Tj T*
( Inspect each return value. Same request ID should not create duplicate effects; production needs) Tj T*
( atomic claiming and payload consistency checks.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
