( 19 / Distributed circuit breaker) Tj T*
( What, why and how) Tj T*
( distributed_circuit_call stores shared dependency health in PostgreSQL. Unlike a process-local) Tj T*
( breaker, it can coordinate multiple instances. Concurrency and atomic state transitions require) Tj T*
( validation.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
( Practical learning) Tj T*
( Compare two workers calling the same failing service. Test simultaneous recovery probes before) Tj T*
( production use.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
( Original source | lines 1270-1322) Tj T*
