(  1272 |) Tj T*
(  1273 |     Open -> half-open \(single probe\) -> closed on success, or open on failure.) Tj T*
(  1274 |     Do not hold DB lock during an external call in a high-throughput system;) Tj T*
(  1275 |     production should use a lease/compare-and-swap approach instead.) Tj T*
