( 20 / OpenTelemetry) Tj T*
( What, why and how) Tj T*
( configure_otel introduces a tracer provider and exporter configuration. A trace is the request) Tj T*
( journey; a span is one operation; trace IDs connect spans. Exporters send telemetry to collectors or) Tj T*
( backends such as Jaeger or Tempo. This helper is not fully wired into local span instrumentation.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
( Practical learning) Tj T*
( Track latency, errors, model name, token usage and cost. Actual token accounting and distributed) Tj T*
( trace propagation require additional work.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
( Original source | lines 1323-1356) Tj T*
