( 21 / MCP tool discovery and execution) Tj T*
( What, why and how) Tj T*
( MCP standardizes discovery and invocation of external tools. mcp_list_tools discovers exposed) Tj T*
( tools; mcp_call_approved_tool demonstrates allowlisted and approved calls. MCP can wrap REST) Tj T*
( APIs and does not replace them. The host must enforce authorization; a Boolean approval flag is) Tj T*
( not sufficient production security.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
( Practical learning) Tj T*
( Imagine an HR leave-balance tool. Discover its schema, validate arguments and require approval) Tj T*
( for sensitive changes. These helpers are separate from the central graph.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
( Original source | lines 1357-1442) Tj T*
