( 22 / Fine-tuning, LoRA and QLoRA) Tj T*
( What, why and how) Tj T*
( train_lora provides optional adapter training. LoRA freezes most base model weights and trains) Tj T*
( low-rank adapters. QLoRA combines quantization with adapters to reduce memory requirements.) Tj T*
( RAG provides changing external knowledge; fine-tuning changes model behavior. Full model) Tj T*
( registry, evaluation, deployment approval and rollback are not implemented.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
( Practical learning) Tj T*
( Use RAG for frequently changing company policies. Consider fine-tuning for consistent task) Tj T*
( behavior. Review training data and keep separate validation data.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
( Original source | lines 1443-1496) Tj T*
(  1443 | def train_lora\(dataset_path: str\):) Tj T*
