( semantic caching; distributed bulkheads; atomic idempotency; durable recovery; document ACLs;) Tj T*
( integrated MCP and approvals; advanced evaluation; actual token and cost accounting; distributed) Tj T*
( tracing; model registry and rollback; infrastructure as code; CI/CD evaluation gates; load testing;) Tj T*
( disaster recovery; SLOs, SLAs and error budgets.) Tj T*
