( Ten memory shortcuts) Tj T*
( Chunking divides knowledge. Embedding represents meaning. Vector search finds similar meaning.) Tj T*
( Hybrid search combines meaning and keywords. Reranking improves relevance. LangGraph) Tj T*
( controls execution. MCP connects capabilities. Security controls access. Evaluation measures) Tj T*
( quality. Observability and resilience help understand and survive failures.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
( An AI architect designs for trustworthy answers, protected data, controlled failures, cost, scale and) Tj T*
( maintainability.) Tj T*
